Z||000009||Tigger||08-07-2001||01:41 AM||||No springs....   ummm tried that..  rides like a go-cart, didn't work to well.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> j/k<P>I've got a set of Street Dreams spindles on my Fiero.  I believe you can still fit the stock 15" diamond spoke wheels, says so on the site, haven't tried them on my car.<P>I replaced evra-thang... bushings, balljoints, tie-rod ends, & shocks.  You don't necessarily have to replace everything, mine desperately needed it.<P><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger02au01.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Here's a pic</A>||||reg||1
